@startuml t12-custom-agent-request-flow
title Custom Agent Request Flow with Skills
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User" as user #aliceblue
participant "Application" as app #lightblue
participant "Orchestration Model" as model #lightyellow

== Initialization ==
user -> app : sends request
app -> app : load_skills → build XML system prompt
app -> model : chat.completions.create(system + user)

== Skill Discovery ==
model --> app : tool_call: read_skill(/sample/SKILL.md)
app -> model : tool_response: SKILL.md content

== Load Additional Resources ==
par parallel read_resource calls
  model --> app : tool_call: read_resource(/sample/scripts/convert.py)
  app -> model : tool_response: convert.py content
else
  model --> app : tool_call: read_resource(/sample/references/REFERENCE.md)
  app -> model : tool_response: REFERENCE.md content
end

== Code Execution ==
model --> app : tool_call: execute_code(/sample/scripts/convert.py)
app -> model : tool_response: execution output / stdout

== Final Response ==
model --> app : finish_reason=stop
app --> user : final answer

note over app, model #lightcyan
  Each level loads only when needed:
  metadata → SKILL.md → resources/scripts.
end note
@enduml
